---
import { withBase } from '../../lib/sitePath';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {getCatalog,entityUrl} from '../../data/repository';
import rules from '../../../data/sources/game-rules.json';
import lessons from '../../../data/sources/game-recipe-lessons.json';
const catalog=getCatalog();
const seasons=['spring','summer','autumn','winter'];
const labels=['春','夏','秋','冬'];
const people=catalog.entities.filter(e=>e.kind==='characters'&&e.birthday_day).sort((a,b)=>seasons.indexOf(String(a.birthday_season))-seasons.indexOf(String(b.birthday_season))||Number(a.birthday_day)-Number(b.birthday_day));
---
<BaseLayout title="生日与送礼规划"><h1>生日与送礼规划</h1>
<p>每天最多送一份礼物，每周最多两份。先确定要培养关系的村民，从喜爱清单中挑自己容易取得的物品；不要只看售价高低。具体礼物可点开查看获取方式、价格及其他用途。</p>
<p>临近生日时提前留好礼物。游戏角色主表列出的喜爱和讨厌物品各有 4 件；未列出的物品不能直接视为喜爱。注视村民也可以在游戏里查看好感度与礼物喜好。</p>
<section><h2>培养关系的顺序</h2><ol><li>每天路过目标村民时先交谈。游戏基础交谈增量为 +{rules.constants.NPC_LOVE_ADD_TALK.value}；无需先准备昂贵的礼物。</li><li>每周两份礼物优先选择下方喜爱物品，生日临近时提前存货。</li><li>完成目标村民的委托，基础增量为 +{rules.constants.NPC_LOVE_ADD_QUEST_SUCCESS.value}。固定帮忙券可按<a href={withBase("/guides/progression/#help")}>帮忙券清单</a>提前准备，随机交付仍以自己的任务面板为准。</li><li>好感度到阶段上限后查看人物事件和回访目标；单纯继续堆礼物不等于已完成突破事件。</li><li>完成 Lv1、Lv2、Lv3 的突破后回去交谈，分别有对应食谱可以学习。各人的食谱见下表，可根据想做的料理决定先培养谁。</li></ol>
<table><thead><tr><th>阶段</th><th>累计上限</th></tr></thead><tbody>{[1,2,3,4,5,6].map(level=><tr><td>Lv{level}</td><td>{rules.constants[`NPC_LOVE_LEVEL${level}_MAX` as keyof typeof rules.constants].value}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></section>
{people.map(person=><section><h2><a href={withBase(entityUrl(person))}>{person.name.zh_hans}</a> · {labels[seasons.indexOf(String(person.birthday_season))]} {String(person.birthday_day)} 日</h2>{[1,-1].map(preference=><div><h3>{preference===1?'喜爱':'讨厌'}</h3><div class="gifts">{((person.gift_items??[]) as {item_id:string;preference:number}[]).filter(g=>g.preference===preference).map(g=>{const item=catalog.entities.find(e=>e.kind==='items'&&e.id===g.item_id);return item&&<a href={withBase(entityUrl(item))}>{item.icon_path&&<img src={withBase(item.icon_path)} width="48" height="48" alt="" loading="lazy" />}<span>{item.name.zh_hans}</span></a>;})}</div></div>)}</section>)}
<h2 id="recipes">村民传授食谱</h2><p>下列等级指完成对应好感度突破，而不是只累积到相应点数。已经学会的食谱不会重复传授；若对话未出现，先完成当前人物事件，并在后续交谈时再查看。</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>村民</th>{[1,2,3].map(level=><th>Lv{level} 突破后</th>)}</tr></thead><tbody>{people.map(person=><tr><th><a href={withBase(entityUrl(person))}>{person.name.zh_hans}</a></th>{[1,2,3].map(level=>{const lesson=lessons.lessons.find(l=>l.character_numeric_id===person.numeric_id&&l.friendship_level===level);const recipe=lesson&&catalog.entities.find(e=>e.kind==='cooking-recipes'&&e.unlock_flag===lesson.recipe_unlock_flag);return <td>{recipe&&<a class="recipe" href={withBase(entityUrl(recipe))}>{recipe.icon_path&&<img src={withBase(recipe.icon_path)} width="40" height="40" alt="" loading="lazy"/>}{recipe.name.zh_hans}</a>}</td>;})}</tr>)}</tbody></table>
<h2>带期限的交付委托</h2><p>交付委托与送礼是不同用途。收到任务后先检查截止日期和数量，把所需物品留出来，再出售或加工余量。随机交付以自己的任务面板为准；同一村民并不总要同一种物品。</p>
<details><summary>游戏数据依据</summary><p>character.dat：喜爱物品偏移 200–224，讨厌物品 232–256，生日季节 420、日期 424。logtext.dat：LOG_ERROR_PRESENT_DAY_LIMIT、LOG_ERROR_PRESENT_WEEK_LIMIT。tips.dat：TIPS_51_INFO_VILLAGER、TIPS_38_RECIPE。</p></details>
</BaseLayout>
<style>section{margin:2rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:1rem}.gifts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:.5rem}.gifts a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.5rem;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;background:var(--paper-raised);border-radius:10px}.gifts img,.recipe img{object-fit:contain}.recipe{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem}th,td{padding:.6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);text-align:left}h3{font-size:1rem}p{line-height:1.8}</style>
